WEBVTT

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.820
Another fun summer comes to a close.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:41.690
The end of summer is 
always so bittersweet,

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:44.080
like the transition from 
high noon to sunset...

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:47.590
Somehow that makes a lot of 
sense, and none at all...

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.410
Well, we've taken care
of our responsibilities,

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.300
nothing to do now but
enjoy the last day of August.

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.050
You're right.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.800
All our summer homework's done.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.180
Summer homework?

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:00.810
You know, that report.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:03.140
Remember? Guy Sensei assigned it.

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:08.350
<b>Summer
Report</b>

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.350
I want everyone to write a report 
about their missions this summer.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.370
And of course, everyone's 
responsible for their own work.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.200
I don't want any collaboration!

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.670
Actually, I call it a report, 
but it's more like summer homework.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:19.860
Treat it as a return to the
 heyday of your youth.

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:26.500
That's not just the heyday of your youth.
It's more like you're from the ancient past!

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.960
You did yours, right, Lee?

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.020
I totally forgot!

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:45.870
<b>Always Do Your Homework 
at the Last Minute!</b>

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.170
You had all this time.
What have you been doing?

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:51.980
It's due tomorrow.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.540
I don't know...

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:59.910
Looks like he's struggling 
with a tough problem.

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.230
I don't remember anything that difficult.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:03.910
No.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:08.000
I can't remember what I did on July 21st.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.710
You're stuck on the first day?!

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.420
I just can't remember...

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:18.230
July 21st... What was I doing?

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.170
Let me guess, Naruto, too?

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.540
Sakura! Boy, am I lucky.

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.810
Want to go to the
amusement park with me?

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.980
Hey, no fair, Bushy-Brows!

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.600
I'm going, too!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.980
I'm gonna have some fun 
before summer ends―

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:37.730
You need to do your homework 
before summer ends!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:41.800
Y-Yeah. You two still 
have homework left.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.450
You can relax after it's finished.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:51.620
July 21st, Sakura and I went on 
a date at an expensive resort.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:56.710
July 21st, Sakura and I ate 
ramen on the Shinobi Sea.

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:00.630
Don't just make stuff up because 
you want to finish quickly!

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:04.990
Serously, you guys, we did so 
much over the summer,

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:07.650
you couldn't possibly 
have forgotten it all.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.110
I don't dwell on the past.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.100
Don't be so proud of yourself.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.510
We're not making any progress.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.970
My summer and my homework 
are going up in smoke.

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.660
If only everyone would help me...

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:25.070
This is such a blatant plea for help...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:28.780
The senseis said we needed 
to do it ourselves, though.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:31.420
They'll never know.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.500
Fine, we'll all lend a hand.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:42.300
Let's hold off on the journals for now 
and do the easier assignments first.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:45.530
<b>Math</b>

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.530
We'll start with math problems.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.940
There are five ninjas.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:51.530
Each ninja can use three different jutsu.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:55.190
How many types of ninjutsu 
are there in total?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:58.770
Good, start with a simple one.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:00.170
I don't know.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.940
Yeah, that's way too hard...

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.780
It is? Really?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.950
If we can't do it mentally, we'll 
have to work it out in real life.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.370
There are five ninjas.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:15.330
Each ninja can use three different jutsu.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.510
Could everyone please use 
their specialty moves?

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:19.540
If you insist.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.390
Got it now?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.890
N-Nope, still no clue.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.920
It's just five times three.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:37.030
300... No, 330?

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:38.850
How did you get that?!

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:43.720
With all those shadow clones, 
the numbers got really big...

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:46.570
You don't count Naruto's clones!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.380
Next is book reports.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.450
Everyone, if you please.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:59.920
Shouldn't the person writing the 
report actually read the books?

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:02.790
What was your favorite part of the book?

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.360
Oh, I haven't finished it yet...

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:08.260
That's not a book report, 
it's an interview!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:12.260
Okay, let's split up the work!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.290
You've got the next page.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:16.380
I'll take page three.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.310
I've got five!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.440
Why do you even need clones?!

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.940
What did you like about the book?

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.280
Page one was funny.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.690
Page three was kinda scary!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.220
Page five got me a little choked up.

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.910
You're reporting on individual pages?!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.280
This is so stupid!

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:35.130
It was really...

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.790
Kinda like...

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.870
The best part...

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:42.480
One at a time! I can't 
understand any of you!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:45.590
Just read the book yourself!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:48.620
Next is independent research, huh?

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:52.890
Think of a new jutsu 
inspired by the summer season.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:57.100
Lee, you should focus on a combat suit 
since martial arts are your strong point.

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.060
Yes.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.540
This is definitely my specialty!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.850
I've got this!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.650
Nejisuke!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:10.120
About time, Leeko.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.360
What took so long?

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.830
Sorry, the line was really long.

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:18.290
<i>Nejisuke and I have been close for years.</i>

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:23.210
<i>I spent the whole summer at his side.</i>

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.440
<i>He's a boy and a friend, 
but not a boyfriend.</i>

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:31.720
<i>I don't want to risk our 
friendship. It's for the best.</i>

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.220
Nejisuke, wanna go swimming?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.250
What is this?!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.600
Why?!

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:10.690
Why do I have to be 
subjected to this stuff?!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.560
What the heck was that?!

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:14.930
That stupid skit made no sense!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:17.970
When a female friend 
changes into her swimsuit,

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:20.930
it suddenly makes her male friends 
excited to see her in a new way.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:22.730
A romantic jutsu.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.890
<b>Romantic Jutsu</b>

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:23.890
You didn't get that?

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.580
Of course not!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.360
I don't even get how your brain 
comes up with these things!

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:33.070
<b>Romantic Jutsu</b>

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:32.440
"Think of a new jutsu 
inspired by the summer season."

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:33.070
<b>A new 
summer-inspired jutsu.</b>

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.070
Seems fitting to me.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.820
Independent research or not, 
that's being way too liberal!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.950
I get it, Bushy-Brows.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.750
Let me try.

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:45.120
When a male friend suddenly 
changes into a woman,

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.940
it makes his female friends ex―

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:48.960
It makes his female 
friends exasperated...

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.630
...with your incompetence!

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.790
You said it, I've had enough.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:56.260
We felt bad, we tried to help,

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.840
but if you won't take this 
seriously, we're done.

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:01.310
Let's go Neji, Sakura.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.730
We're on our own now.

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:12.610
Seems like they're still not done.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.820
Of course not.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.030
Stupid Lee...

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:20.680
You forgot all the things 
we did over the summer.

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.260
You'll never finish that journal.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.760
Today, the homework is due.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:37.400
We've gone over everyone's homework.

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.010
Excellent work, everyone!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.710
Huh? Including Lee and Naruto?

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.590
The journals were outstanding,

00:09:45.590 --> 00:09:47.520
especially Lee's and Naruto's.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.350
Wonderful stuff guys, you really
conveyed how precious...

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:54.690
...the experiences and memories you 
shared with your friends are to you.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.890
How, Lee?

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.700
I thought you forgot everything...

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.160
When I came up with that 
independent research jutsu,

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:07.040
it reminded me of all the 
stuff we did together.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:10.670
Tenten, you and Neji were 
with me the whole time.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.900
After that, I just had to write it down.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:15.880
Lee...

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:18.020
Same here.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:24.310
Actually, I'd like to read the entry 
that Guy and I were most moved by.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.720
Oh don't, it's too embarrassing...

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.520
August 31st.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:34.220
Today, Tenten, Neji and Sakura helped
me with all the homework I hadn't done.

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:39.130
Naruto and I managed to get most of it 
done without having to lift a finger.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:42.910
I wouldn't trade my friends for anything.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.870
So as punishment for 
helping Lee and Naruto,

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:55.250
you're all going to continue writing 
reports until we say otherwise, got it?!

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:58.210
Lee, you idiot!

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:02.420
Get your summer vacation 
assignments done quickly, kids!

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:13.410
This is the Leaf Village Academy.

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:17.820
Its alumni include our very 
own Rock Lee and Naruto.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:21.280
All right, today we're having a 
test on the Transformation Jutsu.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:25.580
Nope, no good.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.930
Try harder!

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:29.530
You've been in the Academy 
for three years now.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:32.220
How can you still be struggling 
with transformation?

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:36.370
For those not aware, this is Iruka Umino.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:39.510
He's an Academy teacher and the 
man who once taught Naruto.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.230
Shoot!

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.510
Iruka Sensei!

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:46.470
We've received word there are rogue 
ninjas lurking outside the Academy!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:47.680
What?!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.930
We've got security ninjas 
on the way, just to be safe.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:53.220
Okay, class.

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:55.360
No one is to leave the Academy 
under any circumstances!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.190
Don't worry, children.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.110
Those criminals...

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:04.280
...will flee in terror at the sight 
of my transformation skills!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.270
Sexy Female Teacher Jutsu!

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:13.320
Why are you catering to 
such a specific fetish?!

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.670
And it's so disturbing...

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:24.680
<b>Class 3-Lee! We Are Team Guy!</b>

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:28.510
Y-You're part of the 
security team, right?

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.360
Can you explain the situation, please?

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:33.910
The main feature of this technique 
is that I'm a female student teacher.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:37.150
I didn't mean explain 
the foolish disguise!

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.570
This is no time to joke around.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:43.860
Our mission is to disguise 
ourselves as student teachers,

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.720
and protect the kids 
from the rogue ninjas.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.580
Try to keep a low profile.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.420
These are the security ninjas?

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:54.200
That's not even a jutsu, it's just a wig.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.540
Listen, you three.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.920
I've got nothing to hide,

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:01.010
I am a ninja who can't use ninjutsu!

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.720
Huh?!

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:06.070
H-How did you graduate
from the Academy?

00:13:07.110 --> 00:13:10.680
If you don these tights and work 
hard, you'll grow stronger, too.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:11.890
Work hard?

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:16.440
Since you're all such good kids, 
I'll give everyone a pair―

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.370
Can it! No one wants your lame tights!

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:21.690
Huh?!

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:24.450
Working hard is for suckers!

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:28.550
We've always been bunch of failures 
and nothing's gonna change that!

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.650
Let's go play soccer or something.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:32.750
Hey, where're you going?! Stay here!

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:37.770
<i>Wh-Whoa... He looks even 
more wild than usual,</i>

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.210
<i>but it's a lame look for sure!</i>

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.960
I apologize. Those three 
are always giving me grief.

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:45.390
They're something else.

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:49.640
I know they're capable,
but they're incorrigibly lazy.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.640
They decided they can't 
do anything and just gave up.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.330
Reminds me a bit of my old self.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:14:01.070
I had absolutely no talent, everyone 
called me the "Hot-Blooded Failure."

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.980
My Academy career was very lackluster.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:07.740
But Guy Sensei's words got through to me.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:11.030
He said if I worked hard,
 I could become a great shinobi.

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:15.950
I hope I can teach those 
kids the value of hard work―

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.330
Lee!

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.290
Hey, we hit that guy!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.750
Man, how lame can you get?!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.590
Enough, you three!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:28.000
All right, Katou!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:28.820
Who's Katou?

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:33.500
Just pretending to be a student 
teacher is no longer sufficient!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:37.020
I will teach those kids for real, 
and show them the beauty of effort!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:41.820
Something tells me that teaching
those three to work hard...

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:44.570
...isn't going to be that simple.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.710
Agreed.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:50.040
Dealing with people like 
them can be very trying.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.720
Have no fear, I've got a secret weapon.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.980
Class 3-Lee.

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:57.670
Leescalante Sensei!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.110
<i>The mountain's silhouette grows dark,</i>

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:02.960
<i>surrounded by the cliffs and the trees.</i>

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:06.960
You're climbing higher and 
higher, then a kunai flies by...

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.960
<i>Your secret weapon is against the rules!</i>

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.100
Everyone close your books.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:14.080
Why are you acting like this 
is a normal homeroom class?

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.640
This is the ninja Academy...

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:21.550
Today I want to teach everyone 
about the value of hard work.

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:24.230
If you want to become 
truly splendid ninjas,

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.400
you need to put forth the 
effort every single day.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.080
Oh, drop it already.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:33.340
Let all the hot-blooded weirdos 
waste their time training.

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:36.070
We're failures!

00:15:36.070 --> 00:15:37.870
Rotten to the core!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:42.890
<i>Being straight is just 
going to make them rebel.</i>

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.670
Rotten...

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:47.280
You fools!

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:48.530
He's throwing fruit?!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:52.440
What's wrong with being rotten?!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:56.450
Fruit is the most delicious 
just before it spoils!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:59.350
He's persuasive, but this 
still seems wrong...

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.750
And that's a banana!

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:04.100
They don't have cores!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:08.190
It doesn't matter if you're 
a failure or hot-blooded!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:12.570
Society functions because 
everyone supports one another!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.510
T-Too heavy...

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:18.780
You're not doing any supporting, 
you're monopolizing the support!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:21.040
Don't you kids have hopes and dreams?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.460
Dreams?

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.460
I have a dream.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.960
Sensei!

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.130
You three...

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:38.090
Sensei, I finally get what 
you've been telling us.

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:40.700
We promise we'll work hard from now on...

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.390
So please don't quit, Sensei!

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.340
Guys...

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:49.430
Okay!

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:52.320
Let's dash off into the sunset!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:17:01.160
Yes, it's to see you three 
learn the value of effort.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.290
That's my dream.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.530
You dork!

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:09.000
You're straight out of an 80's movie!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.150
It's useless.

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.480
Oh yeah.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.470
I mean Lee's teaching, by the way.

00:17:16.610 --> 00:17:17.430
What the―

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.000
The rogue ninjas?

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.350
The kids are out there. Let's hurry!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:29.150
<i>They'll understand if they see what 
kind of strength effort breeds!</i>

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.150
<i>I'll prove it</i>

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:33.150
<i>by defeating these guys with taijutsu, 
 no matter who they are!</i>

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.910
<i>What?!</i>

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:43.000
<i>Those outfits are totally 
not designed to be kicked!</i>

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.270
But...

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.500
I can't lose. Think of the children!

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.460
Dynamic Entry!

00:17:49.770 --> 00:17:51.390
Time out, time out!

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:53.880
Time out on your dynamic brain!

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:57.590
Hey, hard work or not, 
that's just a kick, right?

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.760
A plain old jump kick is boring.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:03.020
Can't he do anything flashier?

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:05.240
I suppose I have no choice.

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:06.470
Shall I use my new move,

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:09.140
the Leaf Great Crimson Great Gust?

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:11.530
Ooh, that sounds cool!

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:13.390
<i>What move is that?</i>

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:14.860
<i>He just made that up on the spot!</i>

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.990
<i>I mean, he used "great" 
in the name twice!</i>

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:21.920
<i>Okay if I put explosive tags on my feet,</i>

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.140
<i>and kick 'em off right before impact...</i>

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:30.080
<i>A perfectly flashy new move!</i>

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.420
Here I come!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:37.680
Wait, no―

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:40.430
Lee went flying!

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:45.390
And somehow shredded his 
clothes very skillfully!

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:50.900
That's it, I'll use my forbidden move!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:54.060
It's time to protect the 
people most precious to me!

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:57.700
There are things precious to your body 
that aren't being protected right now!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.900
Here I come!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.460
Initial Lotus!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:13.090
Hey, Sakura, what're you doing―

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:14.460
S-Sakura!

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:16.420
G-Get away!

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.720
Hell yeah!

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.470
What a disaster.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.150
It was unavoidable.

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:31.810
That move has never worked, 
even in the main series.

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.480
Then why did you use it?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:35.180
These guys...

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:37.150
...are tougher than we thought!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.470
<i>He's wild, too!</i>

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.660
<i>Why is everyone dressing like that? 
Is it the new fashion?</i>

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:43.660
H-Hey...

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.260
if we work really hard, we're 
just gonna end up like him, huh?

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:49.030
Probably... Guess there's no point.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.750
You fools!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.700
You really think you can just stroll in

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.770
and be good at everything immediately?

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:56.840
Even if you have a hard 
time in the Academy,

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:02.010
I've seen shinobi become so strong from 
their sweat and toil, it's unbelievable.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.470
Listen, kids...

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.320
Hard work is―

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:15.360
Right as Iruka Sensei was 
giving his famous speech...

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.820
I'm sorry, Iruka Sensei!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:23.810
But losers like us were doomed 
to be side characters from birth.

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:25.780
Exactly.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:27.490
But still...

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.980
Even loser secondary characters,

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:33.480
if they work, and work, 
and work every day...

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.910
Even the most hot-blooded loser...

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:39.360
...might get to be the 
main character someday.

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:41.840
Here I go!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.050
Sensei!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.030
Use this and you'll win!

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:48.870
Thanks, guys!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.110
Leaf Banana Shooter!

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:56.400
That looks more like a dessert!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.730
And a banana shooter's 
something else entirely!

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.360
Wow...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.080
It doesn't matter if it's 
superficial effort at first.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:12.580
Take it one step at a time, work 
hard, and become great ninjas.

00:21:13.640 --> 00:21:14.580
Yes!

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.370
From then on,

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:29.710
those three followed Lee's example 
and finally got motivated.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:31.760
I'll have to thank Lee and his team.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:33.600
Morning, Sensei!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:37.060
<i>There are some weird trends 
in fashion nowadays...</i>

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:41.020
For all you adults out there 
dealing with problem children,

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:44.350
please, whatever you do, 
don't follow Lee's example!

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:24.820
Next time is 
"Naruto is Lee and Lee is Naruto!"

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:28.060
<b>Naruto is Lee and Lee is Naruto!
I Dream of Walking with the Nine-tails!</b>

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:28.050
and "I Dream of Walking 
with the Nine-tails!"

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:30.030
Taking him for a walk is really hard.

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:33.800
He's just finally eating food out of my hand.

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:34.850
You feed him?!

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:38.600
He sounds much tamer than when he used to run around biting everyone in sight.

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:40.800
You're training him well, Naruto.

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:44.060
Yeah, I'm gonna teach him to shake and sit next.

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.800
Do you two know how
 dangerous the Nine-tails is?
